`\n92: cl -c /Fo:t2_passport_cpp\\main.obj /std:c++latest /W4 /permissive- /EHsc /Od /Zi /MDd /fsanitize=address t2_passport_cpp\\main.cpp\n93: link /DEBUG /OUT:t2_passport_cpp\\main.exe t2_passport_cpp\\main.obj\n94: \n95: cl -c /Fo:t2_passport_c\\main.obj /std:c17 /W4 /permissive- /Od /Zi /MDd /fsanitize=address t2_passport_c\\main.c\n96: link /DEBUG /OUT:t2_passport_c\\main.exe t2_passport_c\\main.obj\n97: ```\n98: \n99: **t3_bbox_cpp\\main.cpp и t3_bbox_c\\main.с**\n100: ```\n101: cl -c /Fo:t3_bbox_cpp\\main.obj /std:c++latest /W4 /permissive- /EHsc /Od /Zi /MDd /fsanitize=address t3_bbox_cpp\\main.cpp\n102: link /DEBUG /OUT:t3_bbox_cpp\\main.exe t3_bbox_cpp\\main.obj \n103: \n104: cl -c /Fo:t3_bbox_c\\main.obj /std:c17 /W4 /permissive- /Od /Zi /MDd /fsanitize=address t3_bbox_c\\main.c\n105: link /DEBUG /OUT:t3_bbox_c\\main.exe t3_bbox_c\\main.obj \n106: ```\n107: \n108: **t4_filter_cpp\\main.cpp t4_filter_c\\main.c**\n109: ```\n110: cl -c /Fo:t4_filter_cpp\\main.obj /std:c++latest /W4 /permissive- /EHsc /Od /Zi /MDd /fsanitize=address t4_filter_cpp\\main.cpp\n111: link /DEBUG /OUT:t4_filter_cpp\\main.exe t4_filter_cpp\\main.obj\n112: \n113: cl -c /Fo:t4_filter_c\\main.obj /std:c17 /W4 /permissive- /Od /Zi /MDd /fsanitize=address t4_filter_c\\main.c\n114: link /DEBUG /OUT:t4_filter_c\\main.exe t4_filter_c\\main.obj\n115: ```\n116: \n117: ### Как прогнать тесты\n118: #### Через .bat файлы\n119: **t1_dist_matrix\\main.cpp и t1_dist_matrix_c\\main.c**\n120: ```bash\n121: t1_build_and_test.bat\n122: ```\n123: \n124: **t2_passport_cpp\\main.cpp и t1_passport_c\\main.c**\n125: ```bash\n126: t2_build_and_test.bat\n127: ```\n128: \n129: **t3_bbox_cpp\\main.cpp и t3_bbox_c\\main.c**\n130: ```bash\n131: t3_build_and_test.bat\n132: ```\n133: \n134: **t4_filter_cpp\\main.cpp и t4_filter_c\\main.c**\n135: ```bash\n136: t4_build_and_test.bat\n137: ```\n138: \n139: При успешном проходе тестов в будет выводиться:\n140: ...\n141: ALL CPP TESTS PASSED\n142: ...\n143: ALL C TESTS 